Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 03:59:51 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Close the Re-check 2 Info items

- moderateNote also rejects every Default_Ignorable_Code_Point (Hangul fillers, invisible
  operators, Khmer inherent vowels, musical format controls).
- Nearby filters private chunks before the 64-row cap and returns the freshest guests first.
- The chain refuses a Zoora-actor privacy-off row, not only the setChunkPrivacy wrapper.
- An import-graph test keeps visitor data out of brain, money, identity, research,
  integrations, trading and shop.
- .env.example lists LUMEN_VISITORS_ENABLED (off) and LUMEN_CLAIM_CEILING (empty).
